        "cache_key": "e6c721a5202a348dfa0a2c732008de4d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "督导同意了。一个闹钟，为什么这么要紧？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "73d306e6a5579789b4ac0b36abb80eaff294b9b671e9c04a9cb34b2b0613a373",
      "words_sha256": "13383027b85e1ac2a488a25819d543500657a51865f09b1a7706799ec1d19687",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ab2c7c80301ee8f2c78759db9dc049b0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "世界排名前一百的单打球员，都在国际网球诚信机构的，注册检查库里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "02e9bb21e8c3ee0335bfe806a8422d691440311a2ca00865a8ce7c881817a33b",
      "words_sha256": "fbbd1023f2e5dc6e4c4d1bdc7335733c70a31583dc7f1773f0c00359cf85136c",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fe13660b96f5ac36e4620bae5dd72c32",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他们要申报一年里每一天的行踪，还要留出一个六十分钟的时段，检查员上门得找得到人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fc07fcc3a7270920e44c6d9cb81822c9c2a82f91e881061c23f63fdf7133718a",
      "words_sha256": "fd09514ad5bce75526483a722b29b550284beedbe45a10c48b6c081253cd6e4b",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "49e67bf4d0079ccd6a372804c129d784",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他报的时段，从凌晨一点开始，人却还在场上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2eb0728a7af77d5f3048170940978331dea09c5c919e3f930708ab64f9520752",
      "words_sha256": "302f0516282ff10413c6cdcca4cf5a6c7d841ef50b652ebad37a554db75b94fb",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "678f032ea7acf5745a1fcb2749dd7da3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "检查员找不到人，算错过检查；行踪没报或报错，算申报失误。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9155981c0182e521f7533829f6a52004afa16d81953c5730d745db22e00a57dd",
      "words_sha256": "192743a191d02346adce6c57abbe646641a40e00d7d4f8e12461c83467ec6f64",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ebfd401977dc72fbe96a8ebd2345598a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "按国际网球诚信机构的反兴奋剂条例，十二个月内两种加起来满三次，就构成违规。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dee618b8778d239c79d9d2d27319d8212b996eab322ba139625df02730091bc5",
      "words_sha256": "5b1874d661b70112aeffbed26432b13a8bdeb09882ab4929c03a45350c2096ec",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "08777470db5b9c4d46f108ccab2c50eb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次违规，禁赛两年，视过错程度最少减到一年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "11a0496f57256d49284080dd62ea57f8dfdb1cb009882e65814df6253501ea5b",
      "words_sha256": "18e65100fb9866efd0e282f0c532080cd469b4dd0011ce240a1f9fd74328ded1",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6fcf62b1412c17ea663e34e310117490",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以，他宁可在场上先把行踪改了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ec0b6de413683451b0feb4171376174fbc26c74fceaea0b8de31411fa4cb1e6c",
      "words_sha256": "d3b897f67c66a2d5ff8e7b63b94771648c4556580e1ea070106de44cd60381b2",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d7cd5bb27e26f74b6971aa841fe968c0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "凌晨一点多，穆塞蒂六比四拿下决胜盘，整场打了三个半小时。凌晨一点还查药检，太严了吗？评论区说说。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
